Changelog:


Prototype No.1:

V1.2.1, 23/03/24
Added back borderlines via graphics  instead of by tableLayoutPanel
Changed input to angle between 0 and 90 inclusive for aOI line
Increased aOI line quality
Reordered and resized textboxes for interactive mode for refracton to be more consistant
Changed angle of incidence line colour to red


V1.2.0, 22/03/24
  Added experimental line movements to interactive mode for refraction
  Removed border lines from interactive mode for refracton (for now)
  Decreased refaction main menu font size (scaling issues)


V1.1.3, 19/03/24 (Final update pre interact mode):
  Improved and added animations everywhere to improve fluidity
  Submenus (not including welcome menu) now stay open in the background to allow users to create multiple instances if they wish and to allow for fluid animations
  Added references file

V1.1.2, 15/03/24:
  Added back arrow for certain menus
  Removed the top bar from some menus
  Reworked 'Welcome!' text to be more inline with the  theme
  Increased font size for the welcome menu

V1.1.1, 12/03/24:
  Switched to dark mode, using black bg and white fg.
  Added button scaling on the main Refraxction menu
  Prepared code for interact mode


V1.1, 10/03/24:
  Added varying label size on the refracton menu
  Added non varying (for now) button on the refaction menu
  Added slight blue tint to the background
